# Cloud-mode build (vite build --mode cloud) — used by Vercel and any other
# remote deploy that runs `npm run build`. Local `npm run dev` does NOT load
# this file, so local development keeps falling through to the
# http://localhost:4000 default in src/app/api/client.ts.
#
# Relative base — the browser sends every API call same-origin, e.g.
#   https://hrs-sys-mg.vercel.app/api-02/v1/auth/login
# vercel.json then rewrites /api-02/* server-side to
#   http://198.211.108.211:8081/api-02/*
# This avoids the HTTPS-page-calling-HTTP-API mixed-content block.
# The smart-join in client.ts still trims the leading `/api/` from
# call-site paths because the base ends in `/api-02`.
VITE_API_BASE=/api-02
